cbsheet 1

# The ground slam: a dive straight down, in the air, 5 s apart. On the tick after it touches the
# ground, everyone in the Shockwave region (a cylinder 5 m around the feet) is thrown away from it
# and up, by every simulation: the brawl mod only hurts them (brawl.slam.hit).

# Its names (the brawl mod's C++ finds them).
event brawl.slam.started
event brawl.slam.landed
event brawl.slam.hit
param inventory.start 1
# How it meets the other skills: its tag, and what it waits out (the guard's tag, the telekinesis's status).
tag attack
tag guard
status pulled

motion Slam on use if not grounded
	tags attack
	blocked by guard, pulled
	cooldown 5 s
	lasts 3 s
	emit brawl.slam.started
	impulse 25 m/s along down replace vertical
	wait for grounded
	emit brawl.slam.landed
	find Shockwave players
		impulse 9 m/s along away
		impulse 4.5 m/s along up
		emit brawl.slam.hit
